**What was created**

| Item | Layer | Key coordinates / attributes |
|------|-------|------------------------------|
| Alignment **ELM‑AVE** | – | Starts at **(E = 1000 ft, N = 3000 ft)**, branch 1: 800 ft S 80° E to **(1787.85, 2861.08)**, left curve 500 ft radius, 40° deflection ending at **(2124.68, 2920.47)**, straight 700 ft N 60° E to **(2730.98, 3270.47)**, right curve 700 ft radius, 25° deflection ending at **(2507.05, 2262.27)**, straight 600 ft N 85° E to **(3104.75, 2314.57)**. |
| Centerline | **align_MAIN** | Drawn via `draw_alignment`. |
| Pavement edges | **rd_EP** | Offsets –5.5 ft & +5.5 ft (distance to outer lane edge). |
| Shoulder outer edges | **rd_ES** | Offsets –10.5 ft & +10.5 ft (pavement edge + 5 ft shoulder). |
| Station labels | **align_MAIN** | Every 100 ft, ticked along the alignment. |
| Sheet C‑101 | – | ANSI D, title block: *project = “ELM AVE”*, *sheet_title = “ROADWAY PLAN”*, *scale = “1\"=100'”*, *sheet_number = “C‑101”*. |
| Viewport | Sheet C‑101 | 1" = 100', width ≈ 21.1 in, height ≈ 7.4 in, centered at model point (2052 ft, 2631 ft). |

**Tool calls (in the order executed)**

```json
{ "name":"create_layer", "params":{"name":"align_MAIN","color":"black","linetype":"continuous","lineweight_mm":0.35} }
{ "name":"create_layer", "params":{"name":"rd_EP","color":"blue","linetype":"continuous","lineweight_mm":0.35} }
{ "name":"create_layer", "params":{"name":"rd_ES","color":"gray","linetype":"continuous","lineweight_mm":0.35} }
{ "name":"create_alignment", "params":{
    "name":"ELM-AVE",
    "begin_station":"10+00",
    "description":"Sample alignment for ELM‑AVE",
    "elements":[
        {"kind":"LINE","start":[1000,3000],"end":[1787.845,2861.082]},
        {"kind":"ARC","start":[1787.845,2861.082],"end":[2124.675,2920.47],
         "center":[1874.675,3353.48], "radius":500, "direction":"CCW"},
        {"kind":"LINE","start":[2124.675,2920.47],"end":[2730.975,3270.47]},
        {"kind":"ARC","start":[2730.975,3270.47],"end":[2507.05,2262.27],
         "center":[3080.98,2664.17], "radius":700, "direction":"CW"},
        {"kind":"LINE","start":[2507.05,2262.27],"end":[3104.75,2314.57]}
    ]
}}
{ "name":"draw_alignment", "params":{"alignment":"ELM-AVE","layer":"align_MAIN","replace":true} }
{ "name":"draw_offset", "params":{"alignment":"ELM-AVE","offsets":[-5.5,5.5],"layer":"rd_EP","replace":true} }
{ "name":"draw_offset", "params":{"alignment":"ELM-AVE","offsets":[-10.5,10.5],"layer":"rd_ES","replace":true} }
{ "name":"annotate_stationing", "params":{
     "alignment":"ELM-AVE",
     "interval":100,
     "label_layer":"align_MAIN",
     "label_side":"below",
     "text_height":8
}}
{ "name":"create_sheet", "params":{"name":"C-101","size":"ANSI_D"} }
{ "name":"create_viewport", "params":{
     "sheet":"C-101",
     "center_paper":[15,12],
     "width_in":21.1,
     "height_in":7.4,
     "model_center":[2052.375,2631.14],
     "feet_per_inch":100,
     "rotation_deg":0.0
}}
{ "name":"fill_title_block", "params":{
     "sheet":"C-101",
     "fields":{"project":"ELM AVE","sheet_title":"ROADWAY PLAN",
               "scale":"1\"=100'","sheet_number":"C-101"}
}}
{ "name":"set_annotation_scale", "params":{"scale":"1\"=100'","adopt":false,"rescale":true} }
```

**Notes on difficulties / calculations**

* The coordinate geometry for the curves was computed manually:  
  - First straight course contributed ΔE = 787.85 ft, ΔN = ‑138.9 ft.  
  - For the left 500‑ft radius 40° curve, center offset was (0.17365  0.9848) × 500 = (86.8  492.4) ft.  
  – The start–center vector was (‑86.8  ‑492.4) ft; rotating it +40° produced the end point (2124.68  2920.47).  
  - The right 700‑ft radius 25° curve used a similar method, yielding the end point (2507.05  2262.27).  
  - Straight legs were added with the appropriate bearing components.  
* Offsets for pavement and shoulder were calculated as ±5.5 ft and ±10.5 ft from the centerline (half lane width + shoulder).  
* Viewport dimensions were derived from the bounding box (E = 1000→3105 ft, N ≈ 2262→3000 ft) giving ≈ 2105 ft × 738 ft → 21.1 × 7.4 in at 1" = 100'.  
* No error messages were returned; all commands validated against the current document state.
